                              Ping-Pong
                             Version  1.0
                              July 2005
       You steer with the arrow keys, and pause is the standard P.              
And if you press space, the paddle starts to jump!
       The best part is the options menu. You can change almost everything:
from the ball colour and speed to the button, text and menu background colours.
       The game is very simple: you knock out bricks, and they hand out
(or take away) certain bonuses and points. Here they are:
#       Colour          Bonus                           Points
1       Black           Second "bad" ball               +100
2       Red             Ball speeds up                  +200
3       Magenta         Paddle slows down               +300
4       Light red       Paddle narrows                  +400
5       Light magenta   "Drunk" ball                    +500
6       Brown           Second "good" ball              +600
7       Light gray      Paddle widens                   +700
8       Blue            Ball slows down                 +800
9       Green           Paddle speeds up                +900
10      Light blue      "Trail"                         +1000
11      Light green     "Cannon" (key B)                +1500
12      Yellow          "Platform"                      +2500
13      White           One extra life                  +5000

